# Move between repositories

This workspace is often `sajtagent-site` only. That is normal. Crossing into
sister repos is allowed. Do not put OpenClaw or Sprite runtime code here.

- Read freely. Write in the owning Git root. One commit per repo.
- Before edit, stage, or commit: `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`.
- Sister Sprites: `../sajtagent-sprites`. Platform map:
  `../docs/repository-map.md`.
- If this repo was cloned standalone, do not invent sisters. Ask Jakob.
- Same agent may edit Sprites or platform in the same session if that repo
  owns the change and nobody else is writing it.
- `site_worker` / `sprites_worker` are for parallel `/goal` spawn, not a ban
  on one agent crossing folders.
- Report `Branch:` and `Worktree:` for every root touched.

Full map (when nested): `../docs/repository-map.md`.
GitHub: `sajtagent-platform` → `docs/repository-map.md`.
